OL,3,ADead whale found washed up on beach in
OL,4,Astorm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Coastguard urged people to not
OL,7,Ftouch the carcass as it "may have
OL,8,Ftoxins that can pass to humans" and
OL,9,Fadvised people to take care as Storm
OL,10,FBoelo was "still going strong".
